<td id="A2.T8.2.31.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;"><span id="A2.T8.2.31.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Temperature for skill adaptation</span></td></tr>
