</span></td>
<td id="A3.T10.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;">
<span id="A3.T10.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:148.0pt;">
<span id="A3.T10.2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T10.2.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Search the web for information online. Returns web search results with titles, URLs, and text snippets.</span></span>
</span></td>
