<span id="A3.T10.2.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T10.2.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Search for related images using text query or reverse image search. Supports two modes: (1) text search with </span><span id="A3.T10.2.3.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">search_type=‘text’</span><span id="A3.T10.2.3.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">; (2) reverse image search with </span><span id="A3.T10.2.3.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">search_type=‘reverse’</span><span id="A3.T10.2.3.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">.</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T10.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;">
<span id="A3.T10.2.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:170.7pt;">
<span id="A3.T10.2.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T10.2.3.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">search_type</span><span id="A3.T10.2.3.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> (str, default: ‘text’): Either ‘text’ or ‘reverse’.</span></span>
<span id="A3.T10.2.3.3.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T10.2.3.3.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">query</span><span id="A3.T10.2.3.3.1.2.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> (str): Search query for text mode.</span></span>
<span id="A3.T10.2.3.3.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T10.2.3.3.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">image_url</span><span id="A3.T10.2.3.3.1.3.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> (str): Image reference for reverse mode. Supports ‘original_image’, ‘tool_image_N’, or image URLs.</span></span>
<span id="A3.T10.2.3.3.1.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T10.2.3.3.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">max_results</span><span id="A3.T10.2.3.3.1.4.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> (int, default: 10): Maximum results.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
