</section>
<section id="A4.SS2.SSS3" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">D.2.3 </span>Case 2: Iterative Refinement with Color Space Conversion (Rollout 3)</h4>

<div id="A4.SS2.SSS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS2.SSS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This case demonstrates <span id="A4.SS2.SSS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">XSkill</span>’s ability to guide more sophisticated analytical strategies, including iterative refinement and advanced color space analysis.</p>
